{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.842, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 24, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:33.032Z", "t_ms": 6840, "delta": "In Section"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.995, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:33.185Z", "t_ms": 6993, "delta": " 6 of the paper, the authors acknowledge several key limitations and risks of Chat"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.231, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:33.420Z", "t_ms": 7228, "delta": "Dev [C2]:\n\n* **Risk of Overestimating Agent Capabilities:** The capabilities of autonomous agents in software production may be overestimated ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.498, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:33.688Z", "t_ms": 7496, "delta": "C2]. Agents frequently implement simple logic with low information density, and they struggle to grasp task ideas without clear, detailed guidelines ("}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.679, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:33.869Z", "t_ms": 7676, "delta": "e.g., producing basic representations for a Snake game or using static key-value placeholders instead of external databases) [C2]. Consequently,"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.955, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:34.144Z", "t_ms": 7952, "delta": " the authors note that the technology is currently more suitable for prototyping rather than complex, real-world software applications [C2].\n* **"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.157, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:34.346Z", "t_ms": 8154, "delta": "Complexity of Software Evaluation:** Automating the evaluation of general-purpose software is inherently difficult [C2]. While manual verification"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.346, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:34.536Z", "t_ms": 8344, "delta": " across large datasets is impractical, the authors' evaluation focused only on completeness, executability, consistency, and overall quality,"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.626, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:34.816Z", "t_ms": 8624, "delta": " leaving out other crucial aspects like functionalities, robustness, safety, and user-friendliness for future research [C2].\n* **High"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.745, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:34.935Z", "t_ms": 8743, "delta": " Computational and Environmental Overhead:** Compared to single-agent approaches, multi-agent frameworks require more tokens and execution time, which increases computational demands"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.806, "data": {"request_id": "85443f8e0059", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T06:59:34.996Z", "t_ms": 8804, "delta": " and environmental impact [C2]."}}
